<BaseLayout title="Privacy Notice | GearPilot AI" description="The current privacy posture of the GearPilot AI demonstration site." canonicalPath="/privacy/">
  <h1>Privacy notice — demonstration site</h1>
  <p>This demonstration site does not provide accounts, forms, a newsletter, first-party analytics, or intentionally set first-party tracking cookies. It does not intentionally collect personal details through the site interface.</p>
  <p>The current static deployment does not measure outbound affiliate clicks. It does not use cookies, fingerprinting, personal identifiers, or an external analytics service for affiliate-link measurement.</p>
  <p>Cloudflare, as the hosting provider, may process basic request information to deliver and secure the service. We do not currently name a retention period or contact because no production privacy program or public contact route has been established.</p>
  <p>Before public launch, this notice must be replaced with the actual controller contact, providers, data categories, purposes, legal basis where applicable, retention, data-sharing details, user rights, and affiliate/analytics tracking disclosures.</p>
</BaseLayout>
